<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - PairGain raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - PairGain raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>--Robertson Stephens &amp; Co analyst Paul Johnson raised his fiscal 1997 earnings per share estimate for PairGain technologies Inc to $1.28 from $1.18.</p>
<p>--said his estimate is conservative and that he has become &quot;more agressive with our expectations for the company.&quot;</p>
<p>--said the higher estimates reflect anticipated growth in the market for high speed digital subscriber line products.</p>
</text>
